# The Ancestral Mound, from the floor where the Snail Shaman's cutscene wakes the Knight (x 46.3) back along the pits to the left gate and out
# into Crossroads_06 (planned with hk-walkplan room on the disc, margin 0.4). The exit is waited for by the arrival: the door1 spawn
# (28.41, 30.40) is on the top platform, where HeroController.FindGroundPoint puts a Knight entering by a door (docs/WORLD_LINKS.md, Gate arrivals).
at 46.28 8.39
walk 43.79
walk 44.22   # run-up
walk 43.79   # take-off
hold left+cross for 12
hold left for 19
wait 6
wait until HK_WALK_READY == 1 timeout 300
fight 4 0.30 50.62
snipe
guard 2
retreat 0.30 50.62
heal
walk 39.93   # run-up
walk 39.50   # take-off
hold left+cross for 20
hold left for 27
wait 6
wait until HK_WALK_READY == 1 timeout 300
